{"version": 1, "sourceSha256": "1a1176988f6a7a0175fe225423269eae148c08ea1d146b5fbc1dccf67c4ae9f4", "documents": [{"id": "offline-1a1176988f6a7a0175fe", "filename": "READING ANSWERS 21.pdf", "sha256": "1a1176988f6a7a0175fe225423269eae148c08ea1d146b5fbc1dccf67c4ae9f4", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-2/1a1176988f6a7a0175fe225423269eae148c08ea1d146b5fbc1dccf67c4ae9f4.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/1a1176988f6a7a0175fe225423269eae148c08ea1d146b5fbc1dccf67c4ae9f4.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "answer-key"}, {"id": "offline-4a730d28bc6aed07b738", "filename": "READING 21.pdf", "sha256": "4a730d28bc6aed07b738b304e2ec84b5fe133bace7ef007807fd4609cc689774", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-2/4a730d28bc6aed07b738b304e2ec84b5fe133bace7ef007807fd4609cc689774.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/4a730d28bc6aed07b738b304e2ec84b5fe133bace7ef007807fd4609cc689774.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}], "units": [{"id": "4a730d28bc6aed07-p1", "label": "Part A · READING 21.pdf", "part": "A", "sourceSha256": "4a730d28bc6aed07b738b304e2ec84b5fe133bace7ef007807fd4609cc689774", "pages": [1, 2, 3, 4, 5], "questions": [{"number": 1, "prompt": "Substance which is known to decrease absorption.\nAnswer __________", "sourcePage": 3, "choices": ["A", "B", "C", "D"], "kind": "question", "offset": 933, "answer": {"text": ":A", "source": {"id": "offline-1a1176988f6a7a0175fe", "filename": "READING ANSWERS 21.pdf", "sha256": "1a1176988f6a7a0175fe225423269eae148c08ea1d146b5fbc1dccf67c4ae9f4", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-2/1a1176988f6a7a0175fe225423269eae148c08ea1d146b5fbc1dccf67c4ae9f4.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/1a1176988f6a7a0175fe225423269eae148c08ea1d146b5fbc1dccf67c4ae9f4.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "answer-key"}, "page": 1}}, {"number": 2, "prompt": "Various factors are known to create an effect on how drug distribution is\nweakened.\nAnswer __________", "sourcePage": 3, "choices": ["A", "B", "C", "D"], "kind": "question", "offset": 1005, "answer": {"text": "C", "source": {"id": "offline-1a1176988f6a7a0175fe", "filename": "READING ANSWERS 21.pdf", "sha256": "1a1176988f6a7a0175fe225423269eae148c08ea1d146b5fbc1dccf67c4ae9f4", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-2/1a1176988f6a7a0175fe225423269eae148c08ea1d146b5fbc1dccf67c4ae9f4.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/1a1176988f6a7a0175fe225423269eae148c08ea1d146b5fbc1dccf67c4ae9f4.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "answer-key"}, "page": 1}}, {"number": 3, "prompt": "Belongs to the class of medicines called digitalis glycosides.\nAnswer __________", "sourcePage": 3, "choices": ["A", "B", "C", "D"], "kind": "question", "offset": 1112, "answer": {"text": "D", "source": {"id": "offline-1a1176988f6a7a0175fe", "filename": "READING ANSWERS 21.pdf", "sha256": "1a1176988f6a7a0175fe225423269eae148c08ea1d146b5fbc1dccf67c4ae9f4", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-2/1a1176988f6a7a0175fe225423269eae148c08ea1d146b5fbc1dccf67c4ae9f4.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/1a1176988f6a7a0175fe225423269eae148c08ea1d146b5fbc1dccf67c4ae9f4.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "answer-key"}, "page": 1}}, {"number": 8, "prompt": "What causes delay in gastric emptying?\nAnswer ____________", "sourcePage": 4, "choices": [], "kind": "question", "offset": 434, "answer": {"text": "Process of Aging", "source": {"id": "offline-1a1176988f6a7a0175fe", "filename": "READING ANSWERS 21.pdf", "sha256": "1a1176988f6a7a0175fe225423269eae148c08ea1d146b5fbc1dccf67c4ae9f4", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-2/1a1176988f6a7a0175fe225423269eae148c08ea1d146b5fbc1dccf67c4ae9f4.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/1a1176988f6a7a0175fe225423269eae148c08ea1d146b5fbc1dccf67c4ae9f4.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "answer-key"}, "page": 1}}, {"number": 9, "prompt": ".What can reduce effectiveness of blood thinners?\nAnswer ____________", "sourcePage": 4, "choices": [], "kind": "question", "offset": 500, "answer": {"text": ": Cholestyramine", "source": {"id": "offline-1a1176988f6a7a0175fe", "filename": "READING ANSWERS 21.pdf", "sha256": "1a1176988f6a7a0175fe225423269eae148c08ea1d146b5fbc1dccf67c4ae9f4", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-2/1a1176988f6a7a0175fe225423269eae148c08ea1d146b5fbc1dccf67c4ae9f4.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/1a1176988f6a7a0175fe225423269eae148c08ea1d146b5fbc1dccf67c4ae9f4.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "answer-key"}, "page": 1}}, {"number": 10, "prompt": "One of the factors that lead to decrease in body fat is?\nAsnwer ____________", "sourcePage": 4, "choices": [], "kind": "question", "offset": 576, "answer": {"text": "Aging", "source": {"id": "offline-1a1176988f6a7a0175fe", "filename": "READING ANSWERS 21.pdf", "sha256": "1a1176988f6a7a0175fe225423269eae148c08ea1d146b5fbc1dccf67c4ae9f4", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-2/1a1176988f6a7a0175fe225423269eae148c08ea1d146b5fbc1dccf67c4ae9f4.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/1a1176988f6a7a0175fe225423269eae148c08ea1d146b5fbc1dccf67c4ae9f4.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "answer-key"}, "page": 1}}, {"number": 11, "prompt": "How age can have its effect on cardiac output and peripheral vascular\nresistance?\nAnswer___________", "sourcePage": 5, "choices": [], "kind": "question", "offset": 0, "answer": {"text": "Decreases, increases", "source": {"id": "offline-1a1176988f6a7a0175fe", "filename": "READING ANSWERS 21.pdf", "sha256": "1a1176988f6a7a0175fe225423269eae148c08ea1d146b5fbc1dccf67c4ae9f4", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-2/1a1176988f6a7a0175fe225423269eae148c